\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\f1\fs40 Proposed Methodology\b0\f0\fs32\par

\pard{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1 The proposed system will use sensors to detect air pollution in the surrounding area. The sensors will collect information about harmful gases and dust particles in the air.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}The collected data will be sent to a microcontroller, which processes the information and calculates the pollution level. The pollution level will then be shown on a display.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}If the pollution level becomes too high, the system will give an alert using a buzzer or LED. The system can also store or send the data to a mobile phone or computer for monitori\f0\lang1033 ng \par

