\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\fs40 Conclusion\b0\fs32\par

\pard{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sa200\sl276\slmult1 The Air Pollution Monitoring System is a simple, low-cost, and effective system for checking air quality in real time. It detects harmful gases and monitors pollution levels continuously. When the pollution level becomes high, the system can give an alert to the user.\par
{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}This system helps people understand the quality of air around them and take necessary safety steps. It can be used in homes, schools, hospitals, industries, and public places. Overall, the system helps in creating a cleaner, safer, and healthier environment.\par

